          <text x="150" y="294" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Cinzel, serif" font-size="12"
                fill="#9b7ddb" letter-spacing="3">BLADE · THOUGHT</text>
        </svg>
      </div>
      <p class="plate-note"><strong>The blade</strong> divides. It is the instrument of discrimination —
      this and not that, mine and not mine, true and merely comforting. Held point down, it marks the
      boundary at the opening. ◆ Note the honest reading: the most dangerous implement in the set
      corresponds to the faculty most capable of harm, and the tradition knew that when it assigned them.</p>
    </figure>

    <figure id="fig-6" class="plate reveal">
      <div class="plate-art plate-art--tall">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 300 300" role="img" aria-label="The pentacle, a disc with a five pointed star">
